        "TileImage": "$($repository 61b53960-4184-44d2-9da5-f8dc40464dcf).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, [REDACTED]. Enjoying your lovely little holiday in some old motel? WELL I&apos;M NOT! How the HELL do you manage this?! Being on the run, nearly DYING?! Anyway, I&apos;ve managed to track down some more intel (with the help of some old friends) to an IAGO auction in Paris. Your two main targets are the recent divorcees, Belova and Marichal. Both are Kamera members. Marichal is planning to do away with Belova in order to gain her position in the Kamera group. Do away with BOTH of them.\r-V",
